    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\$520$",
      "worked": "The sale price is $100\\%-20\\%=80\\%$ of the original price.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Sale price}&=650\\times0.80\\\\\\text{Sale price}&=\\$520\\end{align*}$$",
